{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】西班牙當局公布上星期高速列車追撞事故69名死者身份。</p>\n<p>當局指69名死者，包括54名西班牙公民及15名外國公民，當中有4名美國公民罹難，其餘死者來自澳洲、日本、阿根廷、加拿大、捷克及葡萄牙等，他們所屬國的領事機構已經接獲通知。</p>\n<p>不過當局同時表示，仍有3人仍然報稱失蹤，包括2名澳洲人及1名日本人。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T00:21:09.637861+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T00:12:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T04:18:37.979749+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T00:18:25.974571+00:00","content_hash":"3b19bf3edba06a79c6dc58e94128c4069e2af55832a8964f5befcf8c10e8b980","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T00:21:09.637861+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}